# The architecture boundary test writes a real file into src/sim/ and deletes it.
# An interrupted run (Ctrl-C, CI timeout, OOM) leaves a node:fs import sitting in
# the one tree that must stay browser-loadable, which then makes `npm run
# depcruise` fail for a reason that has nothing to do with your change.
src/sim/__boundary_probe__.ts

# Harness-managed worktrees
.claude/worktrees/
